{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53999","headline":"十二时歌 四 · 从谂","name":"十二时歌 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"食时辰，烟火徒劳望四邻。\n馒头䭔子前年别，今日思量空咽津。\n持念少，嗟叹频，一百家中无善人。\n来者只道觅茶吃，不得茶童（《偈颂》作「噇」）去又嗔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"从谂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53999.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53999","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}